{{!
    @template block_coursecare/overview

    The "Your course in numbers" page of the CourseCare block (Feature 003, contracts/overview-page.md), as an
    educational experience (Feature 008, contracts/ui.md). Every sentence comes already translated from the
    course_overview renderable; this template only lays them out: the way back, the identity of the plugin with
    its tagline and a decorative illustration, the opening with the volume of the course, then, with a result
    that has files, two areas: "Suggestions for you" (the band of the educational state and the suggestions of
    Feature 004) and "Details" (where the files are and the large files, how the files changed, the materials by
    activity, the potential of the assignments and the technical details), and a closing sentence. Without
    JavaScript, both areas are shown one after the other; with it, they become accessible tabs. Without a result
    with files the sections follow each other as before, without tabs. Sections without data are left out.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="block_coursecare-overview", data-initialtab - the tabs (block_coursecare/tabs)
    * data-region="block_coursecare-tablist", data-tab - the list of tabs and each tab
    * data-panel - each area

    Context variables required for this template:
    * identity - object with name and tagline
    * title, intro, backurl, backtext - title of the diagnostic area, introduction and the way back to the course
    * hero - the opening, see block_coursecare/overview_summary
    * hastabs, initialtab (suggestions or details), tabs (label, suggestions, details)
    * band - optional educational state: title, message, note, isidea, isallgood
    * closing - closing sentence (only with the tabs)
    * hassuggestionsection, suggestions - see block_coursecare/overview_suggestions
    * hascategories, categories - see block_coursecare/overview_categories
    * hashistory, history - see block_coursecare/overview_history
    * hasactivities, activities - see block_coursecare/overview_activities
    * haslarge, large - see block_coursecare/overview_large
    * haspotential, potential - see block_coursecare/overview_potential
    * hastechnical, technical - see block_coursecare/overview_technical

    Example context (json):
    {
        "identity": {"name": "CourseCare", "tagline": "Small choices, a better learning space for everyone."},
        "title": "Your course in numbers",
        "intro": "See where the files of your course are and when they were measured.",
        "backurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=2",
        "backtext": "Back to the course",
        "hero": {
            "hasvolume": true,
            "volumelabel": "Course files recorded in Moodle",
            "volume": "6.0 MB",
            "sentences": [],
            "date": "Calculated on 16/10/26, 10:12.",
            "notes": [],
            "coverage": ""
        },
        "hastabs": true,
        "initialtab": "details",
        "tabs": {"label": "Sections of the page", "suggestions": "Suggestions for you", "details": "Details"},
        "band": {"title": "All good here!", "message": "We found no suggestions for the criteria checked in this analysis.",
            "note": "", "isidea": false, "isallgood": true},
        "closing": "Each suggestion is a possibility. The decision is always yours, based on what your students need.",
        "hassuggestionsection": false,
        "hascategories": false,
        "hashistory": false,
        "hasactivities": false,
        "haslarge": false,
        "haspotential": false,
        "hastechnical": false
    }
}}
<div class="block_coursecare-overview" data-region="block_coursecare-overview"{{#hastabs}} data-initialtab="{{initialtab}}"{{/hastabs}}>
    <p class="block_coursecare-overview-back"><a href="{{backurl}}">{{backtext}}</a></p>
    {{#identity}}
    <div class="block_coursecare-overview-identity">
        <div class="block_coursecare-overview-identitytext">
            <span class="block_coursecare-overview-illustration">{{#pix}} sprout, block_coursecare {{/pix}}</span>
            <div>
                <h2 class="block_coursecare-overview-name">{{name}}</h2>
                <p class="block_coursecare-overview-tagline mb-0">{{tagline}}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <span class="block_coursecare-overview-scene">{{#pix}} illustration, block_coursecare {{/pix}}</span>
    </div>
    {{/identity}}
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_summary }}
    {{#hastabs}}
    <div class="block_coursecare-overview-tablist" data-region="block_coursecare-tablist" aria-label="{{tabs.label}}" hidden>
        <button type="button" class="block_coursecare-overview-tab" id="block_coursecare-tabbutton-suggestions"
            data-tab="suggestions" aria-controls="block_coursecare-tab-suggestions">{{tabs.suggestions}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="block_coursecare-overview-tab" id="block_coursecare-tabbutton-details"
            data-tab="details" aria-controls="block_coursecare-tab-details">{{tabs.details}}</button>
    </div>
    <section id="block_coursecare-tab-suggestions" class="block_coursecare-overview-panel" data-panel="suggestions">
        <h2 class="block_coursecare-overview-panelheading">{{tabs.suggestions}}</h2>
        {{#band}}
        <div class="block_coursecare-overview-band{{#isidea}} block_coursecare-overview-band-idea{{/isidea}}">
            <span class="block_coursecare-overview-bandicon">{{#pix}} sprout, block_coursecare {{/pix}}</span>
            <div class="block_coursecare-overview-bandtext">
                <p class="block_coursecare-overview-bandtitle mb-0">{{title}}</p>
                <p class="block_coursecare-overview-bandmessage mb-0">{{message}}</p>
            </div>
            {{#note}}
            <p class="block_coursecare-overview-bandnote mb-0">{{note}}</p>
            {{/note}}
        </div>
        {{/band}}
        {{#hassuggestionsection}}
        {{> block_coursecare/overview_suggestions }}
        {{/hassuggestionsection}}
    </section>
    <section id="block_coursecare-tab-details" class="block_coursecare-overview-panel" data-panel="details">
        <h2 class="block_coursecare-overview-panelheading">{{tabs.details}}</h2>
        {{> block_coursecare/overview_details }}
    </section>
    <p class="block_coursecare-overview-closing">{{closing}}</p>
    {{#js}}
    require(['block_coursecare/tabs'], function(tabs) {
        tabs.init('[data-region="block_coursecare-overview"]');
    });
    {{/js}}
    {{/hastabs}}
    {{^hastabs}}
    {{#hassuggestionsection}}
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_suggestions }}
    {{/hassuggestionsection}}
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_details }}
    {{/hastabs}}
</div>
